        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions #44 Large Pineapple Reed Entry Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nStunning design door pull handle from the <a href=\"/collections/first-impressions-door-pulls\">First Impressions Door Pulls</a> Classic Collection, combines the traditional beauty of Reed handle with decorative large Pineapple finials. Used on both higher end residential and commercial doors.  Great for large entry glass doors or heavy solid wood doors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available with Contemporary Door Brackets: <a href=\"/products/large-pineapple-door-handle-first-impressions-mds3rddsbr\"><b>First Impressions #44RB Pineapple Door Handle</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis entry door handle is assembled in the USA by the expert craftsmen at First Impressions International, famous for high quality innovational door pull designs. Available in 19-1/4\" or 24-1/4\" lengths and 13 different finish colors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"made in the USA\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions #44 Large Pineapple Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Reed Style Brass Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Standard Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>FII-44A: Total Length 19-1/4\", Center to Center Mount 9\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-44B: Total Length 24-1/4\", Center to Center Mount 14\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This decorative door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b> up to 6 feet long. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged standard for  Surface Mounting with #10 x 1-1/2\" screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>** This item is Discontinued</b>\r\n<br><br>\r\nSee available <b><a href=\"/collections/first-impressions\">First Impressions Door Handles</a> and <a href=\"/collections/wood-door-pulls\">Wood Door Pulls</a>\r\n\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Large Pineapple Door Handle, First Impressions # 44",
                "description": "First Impressions # 44 Decorative Pineapple Door Pulls. Stunning design door pull handle from the First Impressions Classic Collection, combines the traditional beauty of Reed handle with decorative large Pineapple finials. Used on both higher end residential and commercial doors.  Great for large entry glass doors or heavy solid wood doors.  This entry door handle is assembled in the USA by the expert craftsmen at First Impressions International, famous for high quality innovational door pull designs. Available in 19-1/4 or 24-1/4 inches lengths and 13 different finish colors. ",
                "keywords": "FII-44 Pineapple Door Handles, Large Pineapple Reed Door Handles, First Impressions # 44 Decorative Door Pulls, Large Commercial Entry Door Handles, first impressions #44  Pineapple Entry Door Pulls, First Impressions # 44A decorative Pineapple Reed Door Handles, FII-44B 24-1/4 inch door handles, FII-44A 19-1/4 inch door handles,  first impressions #44 pineapple reed door pulls, tropical door pulls, palm springs door hardware, palm springs pineapple home decor,"
